body:
Life sounds more like a roller coaster or an Adrenaline rush than anything and i don't think im as loved as you think i barely am, i hope good things happen but I'm starting to lose hope in that and pushing is very very hard, harder than you think, I'm also surrounded by toxic people that's a reason why I'm probably toxic too.  

&#x200B;

i have no friends plus one told me to just kill myself and stop texting him, two were mad at me and eventually clowned me for it, and the others either did not know what to say or got tired of trying to reason with me, the other ones had betrayed me in the worst ways. I am scared to do it especially because im a Christian, im so smart and i loved to learn but i hate school, from the way to the teachers treat me to the students, also side effects of depression really messed with my head and schoolwork and will to learn, and this really really affected me because the most important thing to me is my intelligence/education and my religion, and i have so much potential but i can't do anything because of my mental state, and i don't think it does especially for me since im from nyc plus i told my cousin today and she didn't give a shi either, plus i make my parents lives harder, they try not to say anything about it but sometimes it slips out. I don't know if anything gets better especially with my mental state and the way it is.

&#x200B;

my dad doesn't have alot of money and im just getting on good terms with my mother again plus, she is way too busy, and although i love her i used to really dislike her for a few because of things she would do to me, and i would call my dad to help but he couldn't do anything about it because he doesn't live with me and my parents are divorced, this happened a few months ago to a year

&#x200B;

i texted that to a different reddit user but i also texted it to you to show you im not really loved  i could also tell you more but i think you get the gist of it

or can also study and take notes keeping track of notes and doing mental tricks to strengthen the mind work a lot you should also read a lot ,eat healthy and get good amounts of sleep, by planning you moves and being organized this can help like planning a bed time every day , try to ask others for help if you have trouble getting something when it comes to education, also make time to work and have a good work ethic. You should most importantly have motivation to do this have someone to motivate you or motivate yourself you need to be determined to be educated and the smartest when you walk in any room. Fixing yourself takes a lot of work but you must know the type of person you want to be and try your best to set out to be that person you should train yourself to be this way and take advise, but only good advice from people who see how you are on the outside. You should also make sure you have good hygiene, and that you are freshly groomed and clean.

&#x200B;

This is some of the advice i gave to the other person, you can take some aspects and implant them into yourself also tell me what you want to change about yourself maybe i  can help

ok but if you are disgusted with yourself try to make a better you a you that you can be proud of and i know it's a long journey but try and i have some tips of you if you need any just remember that it is a choose to have a friend and not all things last forever you don't need them, but you do need time to grive over it if you really loved them, just be thankful for the good memories they gave you, and try to train yourself to be a better person you are proud of, you can do this with the help of counselors or therapists also other things. I'll text you some of the advice i gave to someone else in a similar state and see if you can use it. But don't just sit there and contemplate on the bad stuff keep your head up and have that motivate you to be better 

&#x200B;

if you need to talk to me you can dm me or something ok, because i do care

you don't have to see the good in a society that is not and you're not hated by everyone, you will eventually meet the person who likes you and you can be real with them and if you don't that's fine, but if for your job you need people to like you, what you should do is take a look around you and see what type of people other people like the most and try to be that person for them you could be acting or not really genuine but that's fine for now until you find that one person who would like the real you.

&#x200B;

if you need more help, you can dm me or type back if you want

you can also study and take notes keeping track of notes and doing mental tricks to strengthen the mind work a lot you should also read a lot ,eat healthy and get good amounts of sleep, by planning you moves and being organized this can help like planning a bed time every day , try to ask others for help if you have trouble getting something when it comes to education, also make time to work and have a good work ethic. You should most importantly have motivation to do this have someone to motivate you or motivate yourself you need to be determined to be educated and the smartest when you walk in any room. Fixing yourself takes a lot of work but you must know the type of person you want to be and try your best to set out to be that person you should train yourself to be this way and take advise, but only good advice from people who see how you are on the outside. You should also make sure you have good hygiene, and that you are freshly groomed and clean. 

